WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
You're mid-task, focused and in rhythm. Your inbox is full,

00:06.000 --> 00:09.800
but you are on track with your to-do list,

00:09.800 --> 00:11.900
and in the background someone is waiting on you.

00:11.900 --> 00:16.300
Then suddenly, something you were counting on just fell through.

00:17.200 --> 00:21.500
Before you do anything, what is the first thing you notice?

00:21.500 --> 00:25.500
In your body? In your thoughts? What feelings do you have?

00:25.500 --> 00:28.300
Do you have an urge to do something?

00:34.300 --> 00:39.500
There's no right answer to what you just noticed.

00:39.500 --> 00:41.400
Don't change it. Just catch it.

00:41.400 --> 00:46.500
What you noticed is data. The signal your system sends when the unexpected happens,

00:46.500 --> 00:50.400
before you've decided to do anything.

00:51.000 --> 00:57.100
For the rest of the season, every time something falls through, try to catch that signal before you act on it.

00:57.100 --> 01:05.500
There is nothing to fix yet. Just become aware.
